backend/tests/regression/test_recap_scan_signals.py:109:def _surface_child_stderr(r: subprocess.CompletedProcess) -> None:
backend/tests/regression/test_recap_scan_signals.py:110:    """把**被测 CLI 子进程**的 stderr 抬到测试自己的 stdout 上。
backend/tests/regression/test_recap_scan_signals.py:111:
backend/tests/regression/test_recap_scan_signals.py:112:    ⛔ round-20（冻结审查 v2 §四.4）：本域大量门是跑 CLI 子进程再核 stdout 的，
backend/tests/regression/test_recap_scan_signals.py:113:    子进程以 `capture_output=True` 执行，断言里只带 `r.stdout` ⇒ 内层 traceback
backend/tests/regression/test_recap_scan_signals.py:114:    若只落在 `r.stderr`，**外层 pytest 的两路输出里根本不会出现它**，
backend/tests/regression/test_recap_scan_signals.py:115:    `recap_domain_negverify` 的崩溃识别就永远看不见内层崩溃。
backend/tests/regression/test_recap_scan_signals.py:116:    pytest 会在失败时展示 "Captured stdout call"，所以 print 到这里即接通。
backend/tests/regression/test_recap_scan_signals.py:117:    """
backend/tests/regression/test_recap_scan_signals.py:118:    if not (r.stderr and r.stderr.strip()):
backend/tests/regression/test_recap_scan_signals.py:119:        return
backend/tests/regression/test_recap_scan_signals.py:120:    # ⛔ round-21（冻结审查 v3）：外层判据原先只能**解析 pytest 的渲染**去猜
backend/tests/regression/test_recap_scan_signals.py:121:    # "这次红是崩溃还是判错"，那是随 formatter 变的启发式。这里改为在源头打一个
backend/tests/regression/test_recap_scan_signals.py:122:    # **确定性标记**：子进程 stderr 里出现 traceback = 被测 CLI 崩了，事实明确，
backend/tests/regression/test_recap_scan_signals.py:123:    # 不需要下游再猜。标记串刻意选得不会在正常输出里出现。
backend/tests/regression/test_recap_scan_signals.py:124:    if "Traceback (most recent call last):" in r.stderr:
backend/tests/regression/test_recap_scan_signals.py:125:        print(f"{CHILD_CRASH_MARK} rc={r.returncode}")
backend/tests/regression/test_recap_scan_signals.py:126:    print(f"[child stderr]\n{r.stderr}")
backend/tests/regression/test_recap_scan_signals.py:127:
backend/tests/regression/test_recap_scan_signals.py:128:
